- op: discuss  # 5478
  at: '2026-11-01T22:22:31Z'  # 5478
  by: agent  # 5478
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 5478
  clock: 2  # 5478
  nonce: '5478'  # 5478
  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 9ae4abe13f. 'tracker show WI-fukut' still errors 'ambiguous' and lists both items, but WI-fukut-tisot is now done, so the 'two open items' framing is stale. The collision is not specific to WI-fukut: across 3,036 items, 47 two-segment prefixes collide, e.g. WI-rijoj: AGENTS.md:239, cursor/session-start.sh:24,63 and session_id_helpers.sh:17,96 cite 'WI-rijoj', and 'tracker show WI-rijoj' is ambiguous. The resolver behaves per ADR-0013 (ambiguous prefix -> error), so the remaining work is citation hygiene, not a resolver defect. MECHANISM: two-segment proquint prefixes collide by birthday arithmetic (3,036 items); the resolver correctly fails loud on ambiguity, but prose/doc references written in 2-segment form become unresolvable. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-rijoj."  # 5478
